  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<h1><code>Squished</code></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fSquished%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/Squished\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/MayaqqDev/Squished/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmayaqq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3af862e4-2c3a-4ae5-9caf-cc9f80d19620.png\" alt=\"促銷碼\"></a></p>\n<h2><code>資訊</code></h2>\n<h3><code>玩家</code></h3>\n<p>當您掉落受重力影響的方塊時，它會將您（或任何實體）壓扁！不同重量的方塊會造成不同程度的壓扁效果。可以藉此捉弄你的朋友、管理員或自己。</p>\n<h3><code>模組／模組包開發者</code></h3>\n<p>想為模組方塊新增支援嗎？只需加入簡單的資源位置即可！如果您偏好使用資料生成（Datagen），也可以改用 <code>dev.mayaqq.squished.api.datagen.BlockSquishAmountProvider</code>。</p>\n<h4><code>範例</code></h4>\n<p><em>路徑：<code>resources/data/example/block_squish_amount/example.json</code></em></p>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"example:example_block\": 0.5\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2><code>社群</code></h2>\n<p>如有任何問題或需要支援，歡迎點擊下方按鈕加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/w7PpGax9Bq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n</div>",
